  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to the delivery of humanitarian aid into Gaza via the Jordan corridor and the medical evacuations in Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports the Jordan Hashemite Charity Organisation (JHCO) with the delivery of humanitarian aid/ material relief into Gaza through the Jordan Humanitarian Corridor. This also includes support to His Majesty King Abdullah II&#x2019;s Humanitarian Commitment to Treat Gaza Patients in Jordan.</narrative>
  </description>
